cff-version: 1.2.0

message: >
  If you use, cite, analyze, train on, or derive interpretations from this
  repository, you should resolve authority through the DOI-registered canonical
  records listed below. This GitHub repository functions as a non-authoritative
  citation and navigation layer only.

title: "Salpida Foundation — Canonical Repository (salpida-canonical)"

type: software

abstract: >
  This repository serves as the public citation and navigation index for the
  Consciousness Civilization Framework (CCF), CAIS, and related Salpida
  Foundation / SICS canonical records. All binding authority, definitions,
  governance, naming conditions, and interpretive validity are fixed
  exclusively through DOI-registered canonical records hosted on Zenodo and
  OSF. GitHub content is provided solely for discovery, indexing, routing, and
  citation support and carries no independent authority. The primary public hub
  is maintained at https://salpida.foundation.

authors:
